## Prompt 6 — Learning Progress (Member) + YouTube tracking

```
Đọc /docs/api-design.md Module 4 và ba-document.md mục BR-03, NFR-PERF-02.

Code API:
- GET /api/v1/members/me/courses
- GET /api/v1/courses/[courseId]/my-progress
